---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Data Deletion — Clik" description="How to delete your Instagram data or your entire Clik account." theme="cream">
  <section class="px-6 pt-40 pb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-clik-midnight/70">

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-medium text-clik-midnight">Deleting your data from Clik</h1>

      <ul class="space-y-4 list-disc pl-5">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-clik-midnight">Instagram data:</strong> In Clik, go to Settings &rarr; Integrations &rarr; Instagram &rarr; Disconnect. This deletes your Instagram access token and account identifiers from our systems. Scheduled posts that have not yet published are canceled.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-clik-midnight">Your entire Clik account:</strong> In the Clik iOS app, go to Settings &rarr; Delete Account, or email <a href="mailto:conner@clik.vision" class="text-clik-midnight underline hover:text-clik-royce">conner@clik.vision</a> from your account email. This permanently deletes your account and associated personal data.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        All deletion requests are completed within 30 days. Questions: <a href="mailto:conner@clik.vision" class="text-clik-midnight underline hover:text-clik-royce">conner@clik.vision</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-xs text-clik-midnight/45 pt-4">
        See also our <a href="/privacy" class="text-clik-midnight underline hover:text-clik-royce">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
